  era: "1991, 2014 \xB7 Section 32 \xB7 Foreign Policy \xB7 1947 \u2013 present"
  title: Look East and Act East
  text: The Look East Policy of 1991 built economic links with South-East Asia. In 2014 it became Act East, adding strategic and connectivity goals with ASEAN and the wider Indo-Pacific.
